WEBVTT

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.520
Duel with me.

00:00:02.520 --> 00:00:03.440
You accept?

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.620
Go, Leadblow!

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.850
Hope Sword Double Flare Slash!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.570
Our Duel's just getting started!

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.950
Here I go, Yuma!

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.510
Alit, let's do our best and enjoy it 'til we drop!

00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:21.510
Sure, Yuma!

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.570
Do... Don't tell me, you...

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:29.290
Did you get hurt when you helped us?

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.600
I don't give a damn about one or two scratches!

00:00:36.280 --> 00:00:37.310
Alit...

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.880
You're going that far to Duel me...

00:00:41.140 --> 00:00:44.510
<i>He's even overcoming pain to enjoy this...</i>

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:46.770
<i>Yuma, too, is feeling that way...</i>

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.850
<i>Additionally, this body of mine's also...</i>

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:57.140
<i>This field seems to have some sort of effect on me...!</i>

00:00:58.280 --> 00:00:59.780
Let's go, Yuma!

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:01.950
Yeah!

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:06.480
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:12.450
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:15.160
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:27.510
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.590
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:01:30.760 --> 00:01:35.100
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:37.470
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.690
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:45.230
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.360
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.530
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:01:52.530 --> 00:01:55.580
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:58.040
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:04.080
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.840
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:02:06.880 --> 00:02:08.300
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:13.010
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:02:13.130 --> 00:02:22.060
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.670
They both have an amazing spirit.

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:40.300
Yeah, they're serious about this.

00:02:38.590 --> 00:02:43.220
"Roar, Chaos Number!
The Final Blow Towards Yuma!"

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:43.010
Yuma... be careful...

00:02:44.390 --> 00:02:46.390
My turn! Draw!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:51.020
I Summon Burning Knuckler Switch Hitter!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:59.860
Then I activate the Magic Card, Burning Knuckle Spirit, from my hand.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:05.080
This card sends the top card of my deck to the Graveyard,

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:07.080
and if it's a 'Burning Knuckler',

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:11.250
I can select another Level Four or lower Burning Knuckler in my Graveyard and Special Summon it.

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:13.290
<i>It's there!</i>

00:03:14.040 --> 00:03:17.340
I drew Burning Knuckler Counter Blow!

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.840
I send this card to the Graveyard...

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:23.930
to Special Summon Burning Knuckler Headgear!

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:29.430
Then Switch Hitter's effect activates!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:33.810
If this guy is used for an Xyz Summon, it counts as two materials!

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.690
Yuma, it's coming!

00:03:35.690 --> 00:03:36.320
Yeah!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.360
I'll let you see the <i>serious</i> me!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.740
Stamp this into your mind, Yuma!

00:03:42.490 --> 00:03:49.120
I Overlay the Level Four Burning Knuckler Switch Hitter, counting as two, and Burning Knuckler Headgear!

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.330
With these three Monsters, I build the Overlay Network!

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:56.250
Xyz Summon!

00:03:57.880 --> 00:04:00.760
Appear, Number 105!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.060
Burning Knuckler Cestus the Meteor!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:15.900
Number 105?!

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:18.110
An Over-Hundred Number.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.440
This is Alit's Ace Monster.

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:26.450
With Cestus the Meteor, I attack Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:31.540
You can't! Hope has 5000 Attack Points
 due to Fiery Fervor, you know!

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:34.330
Yeah! When I say I'm going, I keep on going!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:38.090
Go! Stardust Impact!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:42.550
Careful, Yuma.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:45.260
For sure, something is up with that Monster!

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.390
I know.

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:51.850
Right! I detach one Overlay Unit to negate the Monster's attack!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.430
Moon Barrier!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.810
I'll break through!

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:59.860
I also detach one Overlay Unit to activate Cestus' effect!

00:05:00.190 --> 00:05:03.820
When Cestus' Attack Power is lower than the opposing Monster's,

00:05:03.990 --> 00:05:07.490
this battle can't be negated and he won't get destroyed!

00:05:08.700 --> 00:05:12.500
Additionally, the damage I would receive is inflicted to you instead!

00:05:12.790 --> 00:05:13.580
What?!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:16.960
Hope and Cestus have a difference of 2500 Attack Points!

00:05:17.540 --> 00:05:19.210
And I'll take that amount of damage?!

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.420
Take this again! Stardust Impact!!

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.940
I set one card and end my turn!

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.520
Oh... No way!

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:42.780
With a single blow, his Life is 500.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.820
It'll be bad if this continues, Yuma!

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.240
Yuma...

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.500
What's the matter? Is our enjoyable Duel over already?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.960
Not yet! There's still a lot left to enjoy!

00:05:57.960 --> 00:06:00.630
But we only have 500 Life left.

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:02.880
If this goes on...

00:06:03.050 --> 00:06:04.130
I know!

00:06:04.380 --> 00:06:07.380
This is a Duel neither of us can lose.

00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:12.140
But... still, I want to make this Duel something special!

00:06:12.850 --> 00:06:16.180
Up until now, we've been fighting against
 a bunch of different guys.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:20.650
I've been fighting to collect Numbers and to keep them from being taken away.

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:22.110
But him..

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:27.320
Fighting with Alit, I just can't help getting totally fired up!

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:28.820
I'm practically <i>burning</i>!

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:30.530
Yuma...

00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:35.910
It's impossible for me to stop those burning feelings of yours.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.920
In that case, I guess I have no choice but to go along with you.

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.670
Let's go, Astral!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.130
My turn! Draw!

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:52.180
Alit! Now we'll show you our full power mode!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:53.850
Let's go, Yuma!

00:06:53.850 --> 00:06:54.760
Yeah!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.810
I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.020
Me...

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.190
Along with me...

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:04.440
...will Overlay!

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.160
When two distant souls connect,

00:07:20.580 --> 00:07:23.210
a power handed down from long ago shall awaken!

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.050
Xyz Change!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.630
ZEXAL!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:35.680
Yuma... Astral... Is this what you call your 'full power'?!

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:38.770
That's cool! That's so cool!

00:07:39.520 --> 00:07:40.640
So that's ZEXAL...

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.360
I guess these guys just don't know how to give up.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:49.860
That's right! Yuma and Astral definitely won't give up!

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.150
Go! ZEXAL!

00:07:52.610 --> 00:07:56.620
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Treasure!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:08:02.500
For each Xyz Monster on the field, I can draw one card!

00:08:02.960 --> 00:08:05.250
There are two Monsters on the field.

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:08.750
Therefore, I draw two cards!

00:08:08.840 --> 00:08:09.420
Yuma!

00:08:09.420 --> 00:08:10.210
Let's go!

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:14.140
I take Aspiring Emperor - Hope as Xyz Material and...

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.560
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:08:19.020 --> 00:08:22.640
Come forth, Chaos Number 39!

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:30.530
The messenger, who changes chaos into light!
 Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:36.200
Hope Ray!

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.080
But isn't that bad?

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:41.250
His Attack Power has decreased from 5000 to 2500.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:43.250
No, this is good.

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:50.050
Cestus the Meteor effect can only be activated when the opposing Monster's Attack Power is higher.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.010
Let's go, Astral!

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.840
We're bringing out all our power!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:57.680
Bring it! I'll savor it!

00:08:58.300 --> 00:09:00.640
Go, Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:03.430
Attack Cestus the Meteor!

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:06.060
Push him back! Cestus the Meteor!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:09.980
But if this goes on, it's a draw!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.400
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:27.500
But in this moment, I activate the Quick-Play Magic Xyz, Stand-Up!

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:28.540
What?

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:34.760
When one Xyz Monster on our field is destroyed by battle and sent to the Graveyard,

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:40.390
then, with it's Monster Effect negated, 
that Monster can be Special Summoned!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.600
Be revived! Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:53.900
Oh, Hope Ray revived!

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:58.570
Challenging Cestus the Meteor was a desperate move to bury him.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:02.910
That's our power, the power of ZEXAL!

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:05.410
I'm so happy!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:09.330
Well then, guess it's about time I show you <i>my</i> inner power!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:10.210
What?!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:16.630
Cestus the Meteor is back on Alit's field!

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:18.840
Don't tell me!

00:10:23.140 --> 00:10:24.640
You're not the only ones!

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:28.350
I, too, activated Xyz Stand Up!

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.650
The same card as ours!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:37.610
A Monster that was Special Summoned by Xyz Stand Up can't attack on that turn.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.200
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.950
Alit... you...

00:10:51.290 --> 00:10:53.420
This is the best, Yuma!

00:10:54.630 --> 00:10:57.420
I can feel that you guys are serious.

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:02.300
That's right, I was looking for a Duel like this!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:06.310
I'll beat you with all the force of my feelings!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:12.060
Sure, Alit! I'll also beat you with everything I have in this Duel!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:16.360
Sounds like fun! I'll also give my all here!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:24.070
Barial Force!

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:30.080
See my true form, my true feelings!

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.090
Alit... You're going that far...?

00:11:47.390 --> 00:11:49.730
This is... Alit's...

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:58.650
...true form!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.610
That's the guy's true form.

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:08.700
<i>This is Alit... But Alit still is Alit.</i>

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:13.580
Yuma, now everything is complete.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:16.790
Now the fun starts! Come!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:27.680
Alit...

00:12:28.310 --> 00:12:29.470
Here comes!

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:32.310
My turn! Draw!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:36.520
I activate the Magic Card, Xyz Treasure!

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:41.440
For each Xyz Monster on the field, I can draw one card.

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:47.160
There are two Monsters, which means I draw two cards!

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:49.370
Here I come, Yuma.

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:53.410
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:55.500
What? Rank-Up?

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.290
The Number will be Ranked-Up?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.920
With this card, I can Rank-Up my Xyz Monster,

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:04.470
and Special Summon a Chaos Xyz!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:10.390
I rebuild the Overlay Network with
 the Rank Four Cestus the Meteor!

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:16.350
The Chaos that swallows the Darkness!

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:21.280
You will pierce through the Light!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.950
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:43.340
Appear, Chaos Number 105!

00:13:49.390 --> 00:13:53.640
Burning Knuckler Caestus the Comet!

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:08.070
This is his Chaos Number?!

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:11.120
That's right, these are the embodiment of my feelings!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.830
Caestus the Comet's effect activates!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.750
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit, 
I destroy one opposing Monster,

00:14:19.920 --> 00:14:23.630
and inflict its Attack Power as damage to the opposing player!

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.840
This is bad! If this goes through, Yuma's finished!

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:34.770
Trap, activate! Over Training!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:41.190
With this, one of my Monsters can't be destroyed this turn.

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.900
What?! You outplayed the effect of Caestus?!

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.280
But it still lets me attack!

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.820
Caestus the Comet, attack Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:55.370
Comet Explosion!

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.590
Yuma!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:11.720
Though we received damage, Hope Ray wasn't destroyed.

00:15:12.260 --> 00:15:15.010
I expected no less, Yuma... Astral.

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:18.520
I set one card and end my turn!

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:24.980
Preventing Caestus the Comet's attack... Exciting, so exciting!

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:27.990
This is so fun!

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:31.450
Come on! More of that, Yuma, Astral!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:37.040
More... Guys, hit me with all your power! Bring it!

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:40.330
Alit! This Duel may be heated, but...

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:43.630
You're a Barian and we're...!

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.920
Let's enjoy the Duel, Yuma!

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:52.930
Let's enjoy this heated Duel until the very end of the end!

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:54.470
Alit...

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.310
That's right, Yuma.

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:02.810
You should respond to his feelings... until the end.

00:16:04.230 --> 00:16:05.270
Astral.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.980
Yuma!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.570
Alit! I'm enjoying this Duel thoroughly as well!

00:16:14.070 --> 00:16:15.320
My turn!

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.950
Hell yeah! Come!

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:22.540
All our feelings... We bet them on this draw!

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:25.880
In his Duel, the ultimate Duelist leaves nothing to chance!

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:29.340
Even the cards they draw are controlled by the Duelist!

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.670
Shining Draw!

00:16:32.220 --> 00:16:35.930
It's here! I Summon this guy!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:42.100
Lord of the skies, soaring through the air!
 Seize all beings in your claws!

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.150
Come, ZEXAL Weapon - Eagle Claw!

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:49.610
If the opponent's Life is 2000 or more than ours, this guy...

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.900
...can be Special Summoned without release!

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:54.150
ZEXAL Weapon...?

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:58.660
Then, when there is an Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray on our field,

00:16:58.910 --> 00:17:02.450
Eagle Claw becomes an Equip Card with Hope Ray!

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:09.040
His Attack Power will increase by 2000 points!

00:17:09.040 --> 00:17:10.920
Eagle Charge!

00:17:12.510 --> 00:17:16.510
Go, Hope Ray! Attack Caestus!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:21.470
Hell if I let you! 
I activate Counterblow's effect from the graveyard!

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:25.440
By banishing this Monster from my Graveyard,

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:29.520
I can activate a Trap Card from my opponent's Graveyard!

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:33.150
The card I activate is this!

00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:36.910
Battle Rush!

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:40.660
What?! A Trap from the opponent's Graveyard?!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:45.160
With this, one of my monsters can't be destroyed by this battle,

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:48.880
and then, the Battle Damage I would get is negated,

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:52.340
and that amount of damage is inflicted to the opponent instead!

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.510
Eagle Claw's effect activates!

00:17:56.050 --> 00:17:59.850
Once during battle, I can negate the activation of an opponent's Trap Card!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.220
I expected this! This is the finishing blow!

00:18:04.310 --> 00:18:06.940
Counter Trap, Corkscrew Cross!

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.690
When an opponent's card effect is activated during battle,

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.990
The card's effect is negated and 500 points of damage is inflicted to the opponent!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:18.780
What?! A counter to Eagle Claw?!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:19.700
Say what?!

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:21.580
Yuma, Astral!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:24.450
Now I've got you!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.250
Not yet! It isn't over yet!

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:29.750
I'll show you the ultimate power!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.050
Counter Trap, activate! Last Chance!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:38.470
It activates one Counter Trap in the opponent's Graveyard!

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.220
Say what?! From my Graveyard?!

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:45.020
I activate Counter's High!

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:49.600
A Counter Trap activated during battle is negated and destroyed!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.980
Then the damage received with this battle is doubled!

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:57.440
Tha... That's impossible!

00:18:57.740 --> 00:19:01.490
Here goes! I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.330
Eagle Counter Magnum!

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.380
Hope Sword Chaos Eagle Slash!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:38.900
Alit!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:48.660
Alit!

00:19:52.790 --> 00:19:55.040
Hey, Alit! Alit!

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.340
Are you okay?! Hey!

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.390
That was fun, Yuma.

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:10.180
Yeah, for me too. Let's do it again some time.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:18.690
Alit! You... can't be...

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:24.490
Astral... Take my soul with you.

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.290
Astral!

00:20:36.790 --> 00:20:39.590
I can't absorb the Number...

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.300
Seems like it's time for me to go home, Yuma.

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:49.180
See ya.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.100
Hey! Alit!

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:55.020
Alit...

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.780
Astral?! Astral!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.700
Astral, what happened?! Astral!

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.670
Hey, Gilag, was that you?

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.220
You didn't need to do that!

00:21:24.220 --> 00:21:24.970
I'll...

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:28.890
You are...

00:21:32.470 --> 00:21:35.520
Hey, Astral... Astral!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:45.610
Hey, Alit?!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.950
Alit... You...

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.370
I've been had...

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:53.120
B-By who?!

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.580
Shin...getsu...

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:00.590
Alit! Get a hold of yourself! Alit!

00:22:01.210 --> 00:22:02.460
Alit!

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.050
Alit!!

00:22:17.480 --> 00:22:24.360
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:32.030
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:32.030 --> 00:22:39.620
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:46.970
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.550 --> 00:23:03.900
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.900 --> 00:23:08.700
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:19.040
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:27.590
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.590 --> 00:23:32.390
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:38.680
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:42.310
Gilag sends a letter of challenge to Shingetsu,

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:44.940
telling him to get over there so he can beat him up.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:47.820
I'm not sure what happened, but he's not like that!

00:23:48.440 --> 00:23:49.320
Shingetsu!

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.240
I believe in you!

00:23:51.950 --> 00:23:53.820
Alit's been hurt?!

00:23:53.820 --> 00:23:56.700
His spirit's far more intense than before!

00:23:56.700 --> 00:23:59.000
Yuma's helping Shingetsu-<i>kun</i> out?

00:23:59.040 --> 00:24:01.120
That's Gilag's Number!

00:24:01.410 --> 00:24:03.330
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.840
"Gilag's Brutal Assault! Explode Forth,
Bukotsu the Pressure Point-Striking Delinquent"

00:24:06.920 --> 00:24:09.090
I'm going to protect Shingetsu!
